        "title": "Strategy for This Problem",
        "text": "We want tan x = sin x / cos x on the right side.\n\nLook at the denominator: 1 + cos 2x. If we use cos 2x = 2cos²x - 1, then:\n1 + (2cos²x - 1) = 2cos²x\n\nThis gives us cos²x in the denominator!",
